WEBVTT

00:00:04.096 --> 00:00:05.924
Guys! Guys?

00:00:06.098 --> 00:00:07.795
- Hey, Po.
- What? Sorry.

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:09.449
So that was stealth mode, huh?

00:00:09.623 --> 00:00:12.104
To be honest,
not one of my stronger modes.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:14.541
...gold in there, come on!

00:00:14.715 --> 00:00:17.283
- [gasps]
- [Wolf] This rice is raw!

00:00:17.457 --> 00:00:20.025
You stole all my metal pots
for Lord Shen!

00:00:20.199 --> 00:00:23.811
- Either you cook my rice,
or I cook you!
- My apologies.

00:00:23.986 --> 00:00:26.075
Po, do something.

00:00:26.249 --> 00:00:28.991
How am I supposed to help her
cook rice without getting
caught?

00:00:29.165 --> 00:00:31.123
- Wait, I have a better idea.
- [Wolf] ...two...

00:00:31.297 --> 00:00:32.298
One.

00:00:32.472 --> 00:00:34.257
- Hey.
- Hey.

00:00:36.476 --> 00:00:39.392
[Wolf] Ooh! Aargh! [groans]

00:00:39.566 --> 00:00:41.394
- Aaargh!
- [blows thud]

00:00:41.568 --> 00:00:43.570
Ooh. Ah.

00:00:44.136 --> 00:00:45.964
Yuck!

00:00:46.138 --> 00:00:48.184
We're here to liberate
the city and bring Shen
to justice.

00:00:48.358 --> 00:00:50.229
- You will need help.
- Thank you, brave sheep,

00:00:50.403 --> 00:00:51.491
but it's too dangerous.
I can't let you.

00:00:51.665 --> 00:00:53.493
Oh, no, not me.

00:00:53.667 --> 00:00:54.842
It's not safe to speak here.

00:00:55.017 --> 00:00:56.322
Right.

00:00:56.496 --> 00:00:57.367
Ooh.

00:00:57.541 --> 00:00:58.934
[screams]

00:00:59.108 --> 00:01:01.414
I'm talking about Masters Ox
and Croc.

00:01:01.588 --> 00:01:04.461
They're in Gongmen Jail
on Black Dragon Alley.

00:01:04.635 --> 00:01:06.767
What? They're still alive?

00:01:06.942 --> 00:01:08.900
They must be in that jail
gathering intelligence,

00:01:09.074 --> 00:01:11.816
hatching a plot
to use their awesomeness
to defeat the weapon!

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:14.297
OK, let's go!
Thanks, sheep.

00:01:15.167 --> 00:01:16.864
Hey! Stop that costume!

00:01:17.039 --> 00:01:18.823
- Hold it right there!
- Get them!

00:01:18.997 --> 00:01:21.434
- Get them!
- Ooh, sorry!

00:01:21.608 --> 00:01:23.088
Take... that!

00:01:23.262 --> 00:01:24.829
- Keep going!
- Faster!

00:01:25.656 --> 00:01:26.874
Hey!

00:01:30.530 --> 00:01:32.489
[wolf soldiers cry out]

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:38.974
Ha-ha.

00:01:47.069 --> 00:01:49.114
[shouting]

00:01:49.288 --> 00:01:50.289
Surround him.

00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:54.293
- [Wolf Leader] Now!
- [Others] Yeargh!

00:01:54.467 --> 00:01:56.034
Gotcha!

00:01:56.208 --> 00:01:57.079
Huh?

00:01:57.253 --> 00:01:58.254
Huh? Where'd he go?

00:01:58.428 --> 00:02:00.386
Spread out!
Search everywhere!

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:02.040
[Wolf] What about over there?

00:02:02.214 --> 00:02:03.999
[Wolf Leader] Is there
a part of everywhere?

00:02:04.173 --> 00:02:07.393
- I... I guess.
- Then search there!

00:02:12.268 --> 00:02:15.619
They must be close.
I can feel a kung fu chill
riding up my spine.

00:02:15.793 --> 00:02:17.751
Sorry, Po. It's just me.

00:02:18.926 --> 00:02:20.928
Look. Gongmen Jail.

00:02:24.671 --> 00:02:26.325
Aw, it's cute.

00:02:27.457 --> 00:02:30.895
Cute, huh? [shouting]

00:02:32.592 --> 00:02:34.551
- Yah!
- Pi-yah!

00:02:37.467 --> 00:02:39.599
- Ohh!
- Nice work, Po.

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:43.560
At the first sign of trouble,
I'll give you a signal.

00:02:43.734 --> 00:02:45.170
Ga-gah, gi-gee!

00:02:45.344 --> 00:02:47.129
- You mean like Crane does?
- Yeah.

00:02:47.303 --> 00:02:49.653
Excuse me, when have I
ever made that noise?

00:02:49.827 --> 00:02:52.743
Master Ox! Master!

00:02:54.310 --> 00:02:57.226
[gasps]
The ferocious Master Croc!

00:02:58.444 --> 00:03:01.795
And Master Storming Ox.
[chuckles]

00:03:01.969 --> 00:03:04.711
I can't believe we're rescuing
actual legends of kung fu.

00:03:04.885 --> 00:03:07.149
We're gonna free you
from those bonds of injustice.
No problem.

00:03:07.323 --> 00:03:09.281
Gotta be a key around here.
No, they wouldn't
leave a key around here.

00:03:09.455 --> 00:03:10.935
Yah!

00:03:11.109 --> 00:03:13.938
Oh, good! You found it.
Come on, you guys! Yeah!

00:03:14.112 --> 00:03:17.463
We're coming for you, Shen!
Wah-how!

00:03:17.637 --> 00:03:19.683
Wah-hah-hoo-hoo!

00:03:19.857 --> 00:03:21.467
Whoo...

00:03:21.641 --> 00:03:23.165
Guys, are we going or not?

00:03:23.339 --> 00:03:24.818
Do you want to
meet us there later?

00:03:24.992 --> 00:03:26.733
You do want to take
back your city, right?

00:03:26.907 --> 00:03:28.605
Of course we do.

00:03:28.779 --> 00:03:30.128
But if we stand up to Shen,

00:03:30.302 --> 00:03:32.826
he will turn the weapon
on the city.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:36.178
Listen to yourself. You're
protecting Gongmen City by
not protecting Gongmen City?

00:03:36.352 --> 00:03:41.357
- If we all fight together...
- Then the weapon would kill
everyone.

00:03:41.531 --> 00:03:45.230
Oh, would it?
Then we use... a sneak attack!

00:03:45.404 --> 00:03:47.972
- We get inside and then...
- And then you will be
stopped...

00:03:51.497 --> 00:03:52.716
...by the unstoppable weapon.

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:54.848
Nothing's unstoppable
except for me

00:03:55.022 --> 00:03:57.851
when I'm stopping you from
telling me something's
unstoppable!

00:04:08.427 --> 00:04:11.169
Master Ox, I'm not letting you
stay in this cell.

00:04:11.343 --> 00:04:12.997
I'd like to see
you get me out!

00:04:13.171 --> 00:04:14.129
Hah!

00:04:18.742 --> 00:04:21.223
You guys see that?
It's called being awesome.

00:04:21.397 --> 00:04:23.138
Come on! Whatever
happened to being heroes?

00:04:23.312 --> 00:04:25.879
The only hero in this town
is a dead one!

00:04:26.053 --> 00:04:27.403
Aaargh!

00:04:30.667 --> 00:04:33.757
Like I said, you are not
getting me out of this cell!

00:04:35.411 --> 00:04:36.847
[Master Ox] Oh...

00:04:37.021 --> 00:04:38.892
Yes! Ha-ha! Whoo!

00:04:39.066 --> 00:04:41.025
All right, let's go!

00:04:41.895 --> 00:04:43.070
I get the top bunk.

00:04:45.290 --> 00:04:46.944
It's time to surrender, panda.

00:04:47.118 --> 00:04:49.425
Kung fu is dead.

00:04:49.599 --> 00:04:51.557
I... Ooh...

00:04:54.212 --> 00:04:55.344
[stammers] You, you...

00:04:55.518 --> 00:04:58.521
Kung fu is dead? Fine!

00:04:58.695 --> 00:05:02.307
You stay in your prison
of fear with bars made
of hopelessness.

00:05:02.481 --> 00:05:05.702
And all you get are three
square meals a day of shame!

00:05:05.876 --> 00:05:07.443
With despair for dessert.

00:05:07.617 --> 00:05:09.140
We'll take on Shen

00:05:09.314 --> 00:05:11.708
and prove to all those
who are hungry for justice

00:05:11.882 --> 00:05:12.839
and honor

00:05:13.013 --> 00:05:14.885
that kung fu still lives!

00:05:15.059 --> 00:05:16.365
Yeah!

00:05:17.888 --> 00:05:19.411
[growling]

00:05:19.585 --> 00:05:20.586
Monkey!

00:05:21.239 --> 00:05:22.153
Ka-kaaa!

00:05:22.327 --> 00:05:23.589
You! You're mine!

00:05:23.763 --> 00:05:25.591
I'll tell you
what's gonna be yours!

00:05:25.765 --> 00:05:28.464
My fist in your plush,
cuddly, super-soft face!

00:05:28.638 --> 00:05:29.595
[both] Yah-ho!

00:05:29.769 --> 00:05:31.249
Uh-oh.

00:05:31.423 --> 00:05:33.208
Get him!

00:05:33.382 --> 00:05:35.775
- Get me out of here!
- Yes, sir!

00:05:35.949 --> 00:05:37.212
[Mantis] Stop him! Ya!

00:05:40.258 --> 00:05:41.564
Faster!

00:05:45.611 --> 00:05:47.047
Go, go!

00:05:47.222 --> 00:05:49.833
- Lose him!
- Yes, sir!

00:05:51.835 --> 00:05:53.706
- Viper!
- Hang on!

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:55.360
Oooh-waaah!

00:05:55.534 --> 00:05:57.536
Whoo-hah!

00:06:00.931 --> 00:06:02.585
[whimpering]

00:06:02.759 --> 00:06:03.890
What?

00:06:04.064 --> 00:06:04.081
Watch out!

